#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:150
msgid "This will reset all achievements. This action cannot be undone!"
msgstr ""
"Cela réinitialisera toutes les réalisations. Cette action est irréversible !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:217
msgid ""
"This will reset all time based achievements. This action cannot be undone!"
msgstr ""
"Cela réinitialisera toutes les réalisations basées sur le temps. Cette "
"action est irréversible !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:234
msgid "This will reset this year's stats. This action cannot be undone!"
msgstr ""
"Cela réinitialisera les statistiques de cette année. Cette action est "
"irréversible !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:304
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Enjoying OctoPrint? Looks like it! <a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">It might be time to give something back then</a>"
" - thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Vous appréciez OctoPrint ? On dirait ! <a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\""
" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Il serait peut-être temps de rendre quelque "
"chose en retour</a> - merci !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:307
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Getting value from OctoPrint? <a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Then please consider supporting its sole "
"maintainer with a donation</a> - thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Obtenir de la valeur avec OctoPrint ? <a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alors pensez à soutenir son unique responsable "
"avec un don</a> - merci !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/achievements/static/js/achievements.js:310
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Has OctoPrint helped you enjoy your printer more? <a href=\"%(url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Then please consider "
"supporting its continued development</a> - thank you!"
msgstr ""
"OctoPrint vous a-t-il aidé à profiter davantage de votre imprimante ? <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alors pensez "
"à soutenir son développement continu</a> - merci !"

