"timed out if nothing was sent by your printer (and an attempt to get it "
"talking again will be done). Increase this if your printer takes longer than"
" this for some moves."
msgstr ""
"Délai après lequel la communication avec votre imprimante sera considérée "
"comme expirée si rien n'a été envoyé (et d'une nouvelle tentative après). "
"Augmentez cette valeur si votre imprimante prend plus de temps pour certains"
" mouvements."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:267
msgid "Communication timeout"
msgstr "Délai d'expiration de la communication"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:278
msgid "<code>busy</code> protocol support not detected"
msgstr "Prise en charge du protocole <code>occupé</code> non détectée"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:290
msgid "<code>busy</code> protocol support detected"
msgstr "Prise en charge du protocole <code>occupé</code> détectée"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:294
msgid ""
"Time after which a connection attempt to the printer will be considered as "
"having failed"
msgstr ""
"Délai après lequel une tentative de connexion à l'imprimante sera considérée"
" comme ayant échouée"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:295
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Délai d'expiration de la connexion"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:309
msgid ""
"Time after which to consider the auto detection handshake attempt to have "
"failed if no successful connection is detected"
msgstr ""
"Délai après lequel il faut considérer que la tentative de connexion "
"automatique a échoue, si aucune connexion réussie n'est détectée"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:310
msgid "Autodetection timeout"
msgstr "Délai d’expiration en auto-détection"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:321
msgid "First handshake attempt"
msgstr "Première tentative de prise de contact"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:333
msgid "Consecutive handshake attempts"
msgstr "Tentatives de prise de contact consécutives"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:337
msgid ""
"Time after which to consider a position query on pause or cancel to have "
"failed"
msgstr ""
"Durée après laquelle une demande de position en pause ou en annulation doit "
"être considérée comme ayant échoué"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:338
msgid "Position query timeout"
msgstr "Délai d'expiration de positionnement"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:359
msgid ""
"Time to wait after opening the serial connection before starting baudrate "
"detection"
msgstr ""
"Durée d'attente après l'ouverture de la connexion série avant de démarrer la"
" détection de la vitesse de transmission"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:362
msgid "Initial baudrate detection pause"
msgstr "Détection de la vitesse de transmission initiale en pause"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:374
msgid ""
"Some controllers need a bit of a breather before baudrate detection after "
"initial connect. If baudrate detection fails due to a hanging controller, "
"try increasing this value."
msgstr ""
"Certains contrôleurs ont besoin d'un peu de temps avant la détection de la "
"vitesse de transmission après la connexion initiale. Si la détection de la "
"vitesse de transmission échoue en raison d'un contrôleur suspendu, essayez "
"d'augmenter cette valeur."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:378
msgid ""
"Maximum consecutive communication timeouts while idle. More than this and "
"the printer will be considered to be gone. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Délais d'attente maximum durant la pause. Si plus, l'imprimante est "
"considérée comme débranchée. Réglez sur 0 pour désactiver."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:380
msgid "Max. consecutive timeouts while idle"
msgstr "Délais d'attente maximum durant la pause"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:388
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:402
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:416
msgid "Set to 0 to disable consecutive timeout detection and handling."
msgstr ""
"Réglez sur 0 pour désactiver la détection et la manipulation consécutives du"
" délais d'attente."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:392
msgid ""
"Maximum consecutive communication timeouts while printing. More than this "
"and the printer will be considered to be gone. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Délais d'attente maximum durant l'impression. Au delà, l'imprimante est "
"considérée comme débranchée. Réglez sur 0 pour désactiver."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:394
msgid "Max. consecutive timeouts while printing"
msgstr "Délais d'attente maximum durant l'impression"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:406
msgid ""
"Maximum consecutive communication timeouts while a long running command is "
"active. More than this and the printer will be considered to be gone. Set to"
" 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Délais d'attente maximum durant le traitement d'une longue commande. Au "
"delà, l'imprimante est considérée comme débranchée. Réglez sur 0 pour "
"désactiver."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:408
msgid "Max. consecutive timeouts during long running commands"
msgstr "Délais d'attente maximum durant le traitement d'une longue commande"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:425
msgid "Firmware specific settings"
msgstr "Paramètres spécifiques du Firmware"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:432
msgid "Enable automatic firmware detection"
msgstr "Activer la détection automatique du firmware"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:433
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                If enabled, OctoPrint will try to figure out your printer's firmware automatically and adjust some communication parameters based on that.\n"
"                                If that doesn't work out, or you want more granular control, uncheck this and the parameters in question will become visible for you to adjust.\n"
"                            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Si cette option est activée, OctoPrint essaiera de déterminer automatiquement le firmware de votre imprimante et d'ajuster certains paramètres de communication en conséquence.\n"
"Si cela ne fonctionne pas ou si vous souhaitez un contrôle plus détaillé, décochez cette option et les paramètres en question deviendront visibles pour les ajuster.\n"
"                            "

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:447
msgid "Select SD files by lower case path"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionner les emplacements des fichiers en minuscule de la carte SD"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:447
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:537
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:549
msgid "Prusa Firmware"
msgstr "Firmware de Prusa"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:457
msgid "Select SD files by relative path"
msgstr "Sélectionnez les fichiers sur la carte SD par leur chemin relatif"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:457
msgid "RepRap Firmware"
msgstr "Firmware RepRap"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:467
msgid "Disable SD printing detection"
msgstr "Désactiver la détection d'impression depuis la carte SD"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:467
msgid "Ultimaker 2/2+"
msgstr "Ultimaker 2/2+"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:477
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Support <code>TargetExtr%%n</code>/<code>TargetBed</code> target temperature"
" format"
msgstr ""
"Support <code>TargetExtr%%n</code>/<code>TargetBed</code> format de "
"température cible"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:477
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:487
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:497
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:518
msgid "Repetier"
msgstr "Répéteur"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:487
msgid "Disable detection of external heatups"
msgstr "Désactiver la détection de chauffe extérieure"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:497
msgid "Actively pause communication during <code>G4</code> dwell command"
msgstr ""
"Interrompre la communication pendant la commande d'attente <code>G4</code>"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:502
msgid "Send a checksum with the command"
msgstr "Envoyer une somme de contrôle avec la commande"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:510
msgid "When printing"
msgstr "Lors de l'impression"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:531
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:537
msgid "Send line numbers & checksums for non-GCODE commands"
msgstr ""
"Envoyer des numéros de ligne et des sommes de contrôle pour les commandes "
"non GCODE"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:538
#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:550
msgid ""
"Check this if your printer supports commands outside of the GCODE format "
"(e.g. <code>Tx</code> or similar) but requires them to be treated identical "
"to GCODE."
msgstr ""
"Cochez ceci si votre imprimante prend en charge les commandes en dehors du "
"format GCODE (par exemple <code>Tx</code> ou similaire) mais nécessite "
"qu'elles soient traitées de la même manière que GCODE."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:543
msgid "Wait for 'ok' for non-GCODE commands"
msgstr "Attendez « ok » pour les commandes non-GCODE"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:549
msgid "Wait for acknowledging <code>ok</code> for non-GCODE commands"
msgstr ""
"Attendez l'accusé de réception <code>ok</code> pour les commandes non GCODE"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:568
msgid "Support temperature autoreporting by firmware, if detected"
msgstr "Support de la température autoreporting par firmware, si détecté"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:578
msgid "Support sd status autoreporting by firmware, if detected"
msgstr "Support du statut sd autoreporting par firmware, si détecté"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:588
msgid "Support position autoreporting by firmware, if detected"
msgstr ""
"Prise en charge de la notification automatique de la position par le "
"firmware, si détecté"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:598
msgid ""
"Send emergency GCODES <code>M108</code> and <code>M410</code> without "
"waiting for acknowledgement, if detected as supported by the firmware"
msgstr ""
"Envoi des G-code <code>M108</code> et <code>M410</code> d'urgence sans "
"attente d'accusé de réception, si cela est détecté comme étant pris en "
"charge par le firmware"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:608
msgid "Support <code>busy</code> protocol, if detected"
msgstr "Prise en charge du protocole <code>occupé</code>, s'il est détecté"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:618
msgid ""
"Send <code>M20 L</code> instead of <code>M20</code> to use extended SD file "
"lists, if detected as supported by the firmware"
msgstr ""
"Envoyez <code>M20 L</code> au lieu de <code>M20</code> pour utiliser des "
"listes de fichiers SD étendues, si elles sont détectées comme prises en "
"charge par le firmware (micrologiciel)"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:628
msgid ""
"Send long names for writing files to the printer's SD card via "
"<code>M28</code>, if detected as supported by the firmware"
msgstr ""
"Envoyez des noms longs pour l'écriture de fichiers sur la carte SD de "
"l'imprimante via <code>M28</code>, s'ils sont détectés comme pris en charge "
"par le micrologiciel."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:638
msgid "Simulate <code>ok</code> for <code>M29</code>"
msgstr "Simuler <code>ok</code> pour <code>M29</code>"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:639
msgid ""
"Most Marlin forks that were derived from Marlin versions &lt; v1.1.0 do not "
"send an acknowledging <code>ok</code> for a <code>M29</code>. Check this if "
"you run into communication stalls following streaming of a file to your "
"printer's SD."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des forks Marlin qui ont été dérivés des versions Marlin &lt; "
"v1.1.0 n'envoient pas d'accusé de réception <code>ok</code> pour un "
"<code>M29</code>. Cochez cette case si vous rencontrez des problèmes de "
"communication à la suite du streaming d'un fichier vers la carte SD de votre"
" imprimante."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:649
msgid "Always assume SD card is present"
msgstr "Toujours supposer que la carte SD est présente"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:655
msgid "Simulate <code>ok</code> for resend requests"
msgstr "Simuler<code>ok</code> pour les demandes de renvoi"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:664
msgid "If detected as necessary"
msgstr "Si détecté comme nécessaire"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:682
msgid ""
"Some Marlin forks lack an acknowledging <code>ok</code> with their resend "
"requests. Set this to \"always\" or \"if detected as necessary\" if you run "
"into communication stalls on resend requests."
msgstr ""
"Certaines forks Marlin sont dépourvues d'un accusé de réception "
"<code>ok</code> avec leurs demandes de réexpédition. Réglez ce paramètre sur"
" \"toujours\" ou \"si nécessaire\" si vous rencontrez des problèmes de "
"communication lors de demandes de réexpédition."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:689
msgid "Protocol fine tuning"
msgstr "Réglage fin du protocole"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:696
msgid "Wait for <code>start</code> on connect"
msgstr "Attendre <code>start</code> à la connexion"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:697
msgid ""
"Try checking this if you run into connection timeouts due to your printer "
"taking too long to respond to OctoPrint's handshake attempts on connect."
msgstr ""
"Cochez cette case si vous rencontrez des problèmes de délai de connexion, si"
" votre imprimante met trop de temps à répondre aux tentatives "
"d'établissement de liaison de OctoPrint lors de la connexion."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:705
msgid ""
"Wait to load the SD card file list until the firmware capability report is "
"processed."
msgstr ""
"Attendez de charger la liste des fichiers de la carte SD jusqu'à ce que le "
"rapport sur les capacités du micrologiciel soit traité."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:706
msgid ""
"Try unchecking this if the SD card file list never gets loaded after "
"connecting to the printer, due to your firmware not providing a capability "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Essayez de décocher cette case si la liste des fichiers de la carte SD n'est"
" jamais chargée après la connexion à l'imprimante, car votre micrologiciel "
"ne fournit pas de rapport de capacité."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:711
msgid "Blocked commands"
msgstr "Commandes bloquées"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:717
msgid ""
"Use this to specify commands that should never be sent to the printer. Just "
"the G or M code, comma separated. Defaults to <code>M0</code> and "
"<code>M1</code> since most firmware will block until a button on the "
"controller has been pressed if it receives either of those two commands."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier des commandes qui ne doivent jamais "
"être envoyées à l’imprimante. Juste le code G ou M, séparés par une virgule."
" La valeur par défaut est <code>M0</code> et <code>M1</code> car la plupart "
"des microprogrammes resteront bloqués jusqu'à ce qu'un bouton du contrôleur "
"soit enfoncé s'il reçoit l'une de ces deux commandes."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:721
msgid "Ignored commands"
msgstr "Commandes ignorées"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:727
msgid ""
"Use this to specify commands that should be silently ignored and never be "
"sent to the printer. Just the G or M code, comma separated. Unlike blocked "
"commands above, there will be no warning popup when these commands are "
"encountered."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez-le pour spécifier les commandes qui doivent être ignorées "
"silencieusement et ne jamais être envoyées à l'imprimante. Juste le code G "
"ou M, séparés par des virgules. Contrairement aux commandes bloquées ci-"
"dessus, il n'y aura pas de fenêtre d'avertissement lorsque ces commandes "
"seront rencontrées."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:731
msgid "Pausing commands"
msgstr "Mettre les commandes en pause"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:737
msgid ""
"Use this to specify commands on which OctoPrint should pause the print job. "
"Just the G or M code, comma separated. Defaults to <code>M0</code>, "
"<code>M1</code> and <code>M25</code>."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier des commandes sur lesquelles OctoPrint "
"doit suspendre le travail d'impression. Juste le code G ou M, séparés par "
"une virgule. La valeur par défaut est <code>M0</code>, <code>M1</code> et "
"<code>M25</code>."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:741
msgid "SD Cancel Command"
msgstr "Commande d'annulation SD"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:747
msgid ""
"The command to send to printer when cancelling a SD card print. Defaults to "
"<code>M25</code>."
msgstr ""
"La commande à envoyer à l'imprimante lors de l'annulation d'une impression "
"sur carte SD. La valeur par défaut est <code>M25</code>."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:751
msgid "Emergency commands"
msgstr "Commandes d'urgence"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:757
msgid ""
"Use this to specify emergency commands which should jump any queues and - if"
" supported by the firmware - be force sent. Just the G or M code, comma "
"separated. Defaults to <code>M112</code>, <code>M108</code> and "
"<code>M410</code>."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier des commandes d'urgence qui doivent "
"s’insérer dans n'importe quelle file d'attente et, si elles sont prises en "
"charge par le micrologiciel, être envoyées de force. Juste le code G ou M, "
"séparés par une virgule. Les valeurs par défaut sont <code>M112</code>, "
"<code>M108</code> et <code>M410</code>."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:768
msgid "Command to send to the firmware on first handshake attempt."
msgstr "Commande à envoyer au firmware lors de la première connexion."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:769
msgid "\"Hello\" command"
msgstr "Commande \"Hello\""

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:775
msgid ""
"Use this to specify a different command than the default <code>M110</code> "
"to send to the printer on initial connection to trigger a communication "
"handshake."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier une valeur différente pour la commande "
"<code>M110</code> lors de la connexion initiale."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:779
msgid ""
"Commands that are known to run long and hence should suppress communication "
"timeouts from being triggered."
msgstr ""
"Les commandes connues pour s'exécuter longtemps et devraient donc empêcher "
"le déclenchement des délais d'attente de communication."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:780
msgid "Long running commands"
msgstr "Commandes à longue exécution"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:786
msgid ""
"Use this to specify the commands known to take a long time to complete "
"without output from your printer and hence might cause timeout issues. Just "
"the G or M code, comma separated."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier des commandes connues pour s'exécuter "
"sans retour durant un temps long et qui par conséquent pourrait provoquer un"
" incident sur le délai d'attente. Uniquement les commandes G ou M, séparées "
"par des virgules."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:790
msgid ""
"Commands that always require a line number and checksum to be sent with "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Commandes qui nécessitent toujours l'envoi d'un numéro de ligne et d'une "
"somme de contrôle."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:792
msgid "Commands that always require a checksum"
msgstr "Commandes qui nécessitent toujours une somme de contrôle"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:799
msgid ""
"Use this to specify which commands <strong>always</strong> need to be sent "
"with a checksum. Comma separated list."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour spécifier les commandes qui doivent "
"<strong>toujours</strong> être envoyées avec une somme de contrôle. Utilisez"
" une virgule pour séparer les fonctions."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:802
msgid "ok buffer size"
msgstr "taille du tampon ok"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:804
msgid "<code>ok</code> buffer size"
msgstr "Taille du tampon <code>ok</code>"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:812
msgid "Only modify if told to do so"
msgstr "Ne modifier que si on vous le demande"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:819
msgid "Action commands"
msgstr "Commandes d'action"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:825
msgid "Enable the <code>shutdown</code> action command"
msgstr "Activer la commande d'action <code>shutdown</code>"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:826
msgid ""
"If enabled and the system shutdown command is configured, your printer's "
"firmware will be able to shutdown your OctoPrint server via an action "
"command on the serial connection. This could get abused, so only enable this"
" if you trust your firmware and your GCODE files!"
msgstr ""
"S'il est activé et que la commande d'arrêt du système est configurée, le "
"micrologiciel de votre imprimante pourra arrêter votre serveur OctoPrint via"
" une commande d'action sur la connexion série. Cela pourrait être abusé, "
"alors activez-le uniquement si vous faites confiance à votre firmware et à "
"vos fichiers GCODE !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:833
msgid "SD Support"
msgstr "Prise en charge SD"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:839
msgid ""
"Enable upload to SD through serial connection. <strong>Very slow!</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Activez le téléchargement sur SD via une connexion série. <strong>Très "
"lent !</strong>"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:844
msgid "Error handling"
msgstr "Gestion des Erreurs"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:847
msgid ""
"What to do on a firmware error (<code>Error:</code> or <code>!!</code>)"
msgstr ""
"Que faire en cas d'erreur de firmware (<code>Error:</code> ou "
"<code>!!</code>)"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:856
msgid "Disconnect from the printer"
msgstr "Déconnecter de l'imprimante"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:864
msgid "Cancel any ongoing prints but stay connected to the printer"
msgstr ""
"Annuler toutes les impressions en cours mais rester connecté à l'imprimante"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:865
msgid ""
"Please note that if you choose this, OctoPrint will still disconnect from "
"the printer in case of <em>fatal</em> errors reported by your firmware (e.g."
" <code>kill() called</code>, <code>fatal:</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Veuillez noter que si vous choisissez cette option, OctoPrint se "
"déconnectera toujours de l'imprimante en cas d'erreurs fatales signalées par"
" votre microprogramme (par exemple, <code>kill () called</code>, "
"<code>fatal:</code>)."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:874
msgid ""
"Only choose this if your firmware sends error messages that are not actual "
"errors. Might mask printer issues (even fatal errors!), be careful!"
msgstr ""
"Ne choisissez cette option que si votre firmware envoie des messages "
"d'erreur qui ne sont pas des erreurs réelles. Cela peut masquer les "
"problèmes d’imprimante (même les erreurs fatales !), Soyez prudent !"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:883
msgid "Send <code>M112</code> on disconnect due to error"
msgstr "Envoyer <code>M112</code> à la déconnexion en raison d'une erreur"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:884
msgid ""
"If this is checked, OctoPrint will try to send an <code>M112</code> prior to"
" a disconnect due to a (fatal) error in order to disable heaters and motors."
msgstr ""
"Si cette case est cochée, OctoPrint essaiera d’envoyer la commande "
"<code>M112</code> avant une déconnexion en raison d'une erreur (fatale) afin"
" de désactiver le chauffage et les moteurs."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:889
#: src/octoprint/printer/connection.py:48
msgid "Pausing"
msgstr "En pause"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:895
msgid "Log position on pause"
msgstr "Log de position sur pause"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:896
msgid ""
"If you disable this, the <code>pause_position</code> placeholders in your "
"pause/resume GCODE scripts will stay unpopulated! However, pausing speed "
"might improve slightly."
msgstr ""
"Si vous désactivez cette option, les espaces réservés à "
"<code>pause_position</code> dans vos scripts G-code de pause/reprise "
"resteront vides ! Cependant, la vitesse de pause pourrait s'améliorer "
"légèrement."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:901
#: src/octoprint/printer/connection.py:51
msgid "Cancelling"
msgstr "Annulation"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:907
msgid "Log position on cancel"
msgstr "Log de position sur annuler"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:908
msgid ""
"If you disable this, the <code>cancel_position</code> placeholders in your "
"cancel GCODE script and the corresponding data in the print recovery data "
"will stay unpopulated! However, cancelling speed might improve slightly."
msgstr ""
"Si vous désactivez cette option, les espaces réservés à "
"<code>cancel_position</code> dans votre script d'annulation G-code et les "
"données correspondantes dans les données de récupération d'impression "
"resteront vides ! Cependant, l'annulation de la vitesse pourrait s'améliorer"
" légèrement."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:916
msgid "Attempt to abort any blocking heatups on cancel via <code>M108</code>."
msgstr ""
"Tente d’abandonner les échauffements bloquants lors de l’annulation via "
"<code>M108</code>."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:917
msgid ""
"Uncheck this if your firmware doesn't support <code>M108</code> for aborting"
" blocking heatups!"
msgstr ""
"Décochez cette case si votre firmware ne prend pas en charge <code> M108 "
"</code> pour annuler le chauffage du bloc chauffant!"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:922
msgid "Sanity Checking"
msgstr "Vérification de l'état de fonctionnement"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:928
msgid "Sanity check tool commands"
msgstr "Commandes de l'outil de vérification de l'état de fonctionnement"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:929
msgid ""
"If enabled, OctoPrint will not send tool commands to your printer that "
"exceed the number of extruders configured in the active printer profile, or "
"for which the firmware has reported an \"invalid extruder\" error. Only "
"uncheck this if OctoPrint or your firmware mistakenly mark valid tools as "
"invalid and be sure to investigate the reason for that, it might be a "
"misconfiguration you need to correct for proper operation."
msgstr ""
"S'il est activé, OctoPrint n'enverra pas de commandes d'outils à votre "
"imprimante qui dépassent le nombre d'extrudeuses configurées dans le profil "
"d'imprimante actif, ou pour lesquelles le micrologiciel a signalé une erreur"
" « extrudeuse invalide ». Décochez cette case uniquement si OctoPrint ou "
"votre micrologiciel marque par erreur des outils valides comme invalides et "
"assurez-vous d'en rechercher la raison, il peut s'agir d'une mauvaise "
"configuration que vous devez corriger pour un bon fonctionnement."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:934
msgid "Resend Tracking"
msgstr "Renvoyer le suivi"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:936
msgid ""
"Resend ratio threshold. Percentage of resend requests among all sent lines "
"to consider critical."
msgstr ""
"Seuil du ratio de renvoi. Pourcentage de demandes de renvoi parmi toutes les"
" lignes envoyées à considérer comme critiques."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:937
msgid "Critical resend ratio"
msgstr "Taux de renvoi critique"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:952
msgid "Start tracking resend request after these many transmitted lines."
msgstr ""
"Commencer à suivre la demande de renvoi après ce nombre de lignes "
"transmises."

#: src/octoprint/plugins/serial_connector/templates/serial_connector_settings.jinja2:953
msgid "Tracking start"
msgstr "Commencer le suivi"

