"    Please configure the <strong>checkout folder</strong> of OctoPrint, otherwise\n"
"    this plugin won't be able to update it. Click on the <i class=\"fas fa-wrench\"></i> button\n"
"    to do this. Also refer to the <a href=\"https://docs.octoprint.org/en/main/bundledplugins/softwareupdate.html\"\n"
"    target=\"_blank\">Documentation</a>.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Veuillez configurer le <strong>dossier de paiement</strong> d'OctoPrint, sinon\n"
"    ce plugin ne pourra pas le mettre à jour. Cliquez sur le bouton <i class=\"fas fa-wrench\"></i>\n"
"    pour faire ça. Reportez-vous également au <a href=\"https://docs.octoprint.org/en/main/bundledplugins/softwareupdate.html\"\n"
"    target=\"_blank\">Documentation</a>.\n"

#: src/octoprint/plugins/softwareupdate/templates/softwareupdate_settings.jinja2:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <strong>You are running a non-release version of OctoPrint but are tracking OctoPrint\n"
"        releases.</strong>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        You probably want OctoPrint to track the matching development version instead.\n"
"        If you have a local OctoPrint checkout folder switched to another branch,\n"
"        <strong>simply switching over to \"Commit\" tracking</strong> will already\n"
"        take care of that. Otherwise please take a look at the\n"
"        <a href=\"https://docs.octoprint.org/en/main/bundledplugins/softwareupdate.html\"\n"
"           target=\"_blank\">Documentation</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"        <strong>Vous utilisez une version non publiée d'OctoPrint mais suivez OctoPrint\n"
"        versions.</strong>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Vous souhaitez probablement qu'OctoPrint suive à la place la version de développement correspondante.\n"
"        Si vous avez un dossier de paiement OctoPrint local basculé vers une autre branche,\n"
"        <strong>le simple fait de passer au suivi \"Commit\"</strong> permettra déjà\n"
"        occupe-toi de ça. Sinon, jetez un oeil à\n"
"        <a href=\"https://docs.octoprint.org/en/main/bundledplugins/softwareupdate.html\"\n"
"           target=\"_blank\">Documentation</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"

