msgid ""
"\n"
"            Even with OctoPrint you should <strong class=\"text-error\">never leave\n"
"            your printer running unattended</strong>. The electronics in our consumer printers can and\n"
"            sometimes sadly do catch fire, so stay or have someone else stay close enough to physically intervene\n"
"            in case of catastrophic failure.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Même avec OctoPrint, vous ne devriez <strong class=\"text-error\">ne jamais partir\n"
"            votre imprimante fonctionne sans surveillance</strong>. L'électronique de nos imprimantes grand public peut et\n"
"            Parfois, malheureusement, ils prennent feu, alors restez ou demandez à quelqu'un d'autre de rester suffisamment près pour intervenir physiquement.\n"
"            en cas de panne catastrophique."

#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:28
#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:51
#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:80
msgid "I have read and understood this"
msgstr "j'ai lu et compris ceci"

#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"            You also should <strong class=\"text-error\">never expose OctoPrint on the public internet</strong>,\n"
"            e.g. through a port forward. It can and <em>will</em> be found, and bad people\n"
"            <em>will</em> try to abuse it. Don't put yourself at risk, use a safe way to access your instance remotely, like\n"
"            one of the available <strong><a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Remote Access plugins!</a></strong>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Vous devez également <strong class=\"text-error\">ne jamais exposer OctoPrint sur l'Internet public</strong>,\n"
"            par ex. via un transfert de port. Il peut et <em>sera</em> être trouvé, et les mauvaises personnes\n"
"            <em>va</em> essayer d'en abuser. Ne vous mettez pas en danger, utilisez un moyen sûr pour accéder à votre instance à distance, comme\n"
"            l'un des <strong><a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">plugins d'accès à distance !</a></strong>"

#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:57
msgid "Support OctoPrint's ongoing development!"
msgstr "Soutenez le développement continu d'OctoPrint !"

#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Work on OctoPrint is only possible through continued financial support by people like you!\n"
"            If you enjoy OctoPrint, please <strong><a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\">click here to learn how to help with its funding</a></strong> -\n"
"            every bit helps!\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            <strong>Thank you!</strong>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Travailler sur OctoPrint n’est possible que grâce au soutien financier continu de personnes comme vous !\n"
"            Si vous appréciez OctoPrint, veuillez <strong><a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\">cliquez ici pour savoir comment contribuer à son financement</a></strong> -\n"
"            chaque geste aide !\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            <strong>Merci !</strong>"

#: src/octoprint/templates/dialogs/wizard/firstrun_end.jinja2:87
msgid ""
"\n"
"    With all that being said, <strong>Happy and Safe Printing</strong>!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Après tout ce qui a pu être dit, <strong>Bonne chance pour vos impressions</strong>!\n"

